          <h3>Agent-to-System Integration and Tool Governance</h3>
          <p class="practice__body">Tool catalogues over governed APIs, using open protocols such as MCP where they fit, with scopes, limits and versioning.</p>
          <p class="practice__typical"><span class="eyebrow">Deliverables</span>tool catalogue, scopes and limits, versioning policy.</p>
        </article>
