          <h3>Human-in-the-Loop and Execution Governance</h3>
          <p class="practice__body">Actions classed by risk. Low-risk actions run within policy; high-risk actions wait for explicit approval from a named role.</p>
          <p class="practice__typical"><span class="eyebrow">Deliverables</span>risk classes, approval matrix, review interface patterns.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="practice offer">
          <span class="numeral practice__num">04</span>
