          <p class="practice__body">Business calculations in versioned, tested code. Schema, policy and limit checks before anything executes.</p>
          <p class="practice__typical"><span class="eyebrow">Deliverables</span>validation layer design, policy versions, test cases with exact answers.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="practice offer">
          <span class="numeral practice__num">05</span>
          <h3>Auditability and AI Risk Controls</h3>
          <p class="practice__body">Sources, calculations, approvals and resulting system state stored per action, mapped to the controls your auditors already use.</p>
          <p class="practice__typical"><span class="eyebrow">Deliverables</span>audit design, control mapping, monitoring.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="practice offer">
          <span class="numeral practice__num">06</span>
